WEBVTT

00:01:29.704 --> 00:01:31.329
What could we unlock?

00:01:33.163 --> 00:01:34.413
Take vaccines.

00:01:35.121 --> 00:01:40.621
Vaccines won't work if they
get too hot or, surprisingly, too cold,

00:01:40.663 --> 00:01:45.454
so distributing vaccines
requires refrigerators,

00:01:45.496 --> 00:01:48.163
big and small,

00:01:48.204 --> 00:01:50.163
to function reliably.

00:01:51.663 --> 00:01:53.788
Fridges can save lives,

00:01:53.829 --> 00:01:57.829
but all too often,
like any kitchen appliance, they break.

00:01:58.871 --> 00:02:00.829
One study in South Asia found